#### (c) 新增工具方法：沿弹道取该方块的**出口**点（不破坏时必须用）

```java
/** 不破坏方块时的"过穿"锚点：沿弹道取该方块碰撞箱的出口面，再外推 0.05。 */
public static Vec3 positionPastBlockBox(Vec3 hitLocation, Vec3 velocity, Direction face,
                                        BlockState state, Level level, BlockPos pos) {
    Vec3 step = velocity.lengthSqr() > 1.0E-12
            ? velocity.normalize() : Vec3.atLowerCornerOf(face.getNormal());
    net.minecraft.world.phys.AABB box = state.getCollisionShape(level, pos).bounds().move(pos);
    double t = Double.MAX_VALUE;
    if (Math.abs(step.x) > 1.0E-9D) t = Math.min(t, ((step.x > 0 ? box.maxX : box.minX) - hitLocation.x) / step.x);
    if (Math.abs(step.y) > 1.0E-9D) t = Math.min(t, ((step.y > 0 ? box.maxY : box.minY) - hitLocation.y) / step.y);
    if (Math.abs(step.z) > 1.0E-9D) t = Math.min(t, ((step.z > 0 ? box.maxZ : box.minZ) - hitLocation.z) / step.z);
    if (!Double.isFinite(t) || t <= 0.0D) {
        return hitLocation.add(step.scale(1.05D));      // 兜底：整格外推
    }
    return hitLocation.add(step.scale(t + 0.05D));
}
```

